                                "sense_id": "7e24eea8-de4d-3525-a80b-956c797ffb43",
                                "text": "Yeah, but not everybody's mother is a prostitute. […] For as long as I can remember she'd bring blokes home and make me stay in the bed and watch while she boofed 'em. […] One time she even made me do it to her. […] Jesus, man! You boofed your own mother?"
