                                "sense_id": "5fd81e92-69da-35ca-a257-04fc27850ab1",
                                "text": "He was attempting to commit an act called boofing. Boofing is when an inmate secretes a hidden item inside his rectum.\n\"No, Gee, seriously though, my man saw him boofing this on the visit.\" He raises his hand, showing me a ball of something wrapped in plastic with a little shit on it."
